---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import { site } from "../data/site.js";
import { breadcrumb } from "../lib/schema.js";
const schema = [breadcrumb([{ name: "Home", path: "/" }, { name: "Privacy Policy", path: "/privacy-policy/" }])];
const updated = "August 7, 2026";
---
<Base
  title="Privacy Policy | Dallas Flat Roofing"
  description="Privacy policy for Dallas Flat Roofing, a free service that helps property owners reach independent local flat-roofing providers."
  path="/privacy-policy/"
>
  <script type="application/ld+json" slot="head" set:html={JSON.stringify(schema)} />

  <div class="wrap"><div class="crumbs"><a href="/">Home</a> / Privacy Policy</div></div>

  <section>
    <div class="wrap prose" style="max-width:820px">
      <span class="kicker">Legal</span>
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p style="color:var(--muted)">Last updated: {updated}</p>

      <p>This Privacy Policy explains how {site.brand} ("we," "us," or "this site") handles information when you use this website or call the phone number listed on it. {site.brand} is a free service that helps property owners connect with independent local service providers for flat roofing. By using this site or calling the number provided, you agree to the practices described here.</p>

      <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
      <p>We may collect information you choose to provide, such as your name, phone number, address or service location, and a description of the flat-roof issue you are calling about. When you call the number on this site, your call may be routed to or handled by an independent third-party provider or marketing partner, and standard call information (such as the number you called from and the time of the call) may be collected. We may also automatically collect limited technical data through your browser, such as IP address, device and browser type, pages viewed, and referring pages, using cookies and similar technologies.</p>

      <h2>How We Use Information</h2>
      <p>We use the information to connect you with an independent local service provider that can help with your request, to respond to your inquiry, to operate and improve this website, and to measure the performance of our advertising. We do not sell your personal information.</p>

      <h2>How Information Is Shared</h2>
      <p>To fulfill your request, information you provide may be shared with independent third-party service providers and marketing partners who arrange or perform the flat-roofing work. These providers are independent businesses, not employees or agents of this site. We may also share information with vendors that support this website (such as hosting and analytics providers) and where required by law.</p>

      <h2>Calls and Consent</h2>
      <p>By providing your phone number and calling or requesting contact, you consent to be contacted by phone or text at the number provided regarding your request, including through automated technology where applicable. Message and data rates may apply, and you can opt out of further contact at any time. Calls may be recorded or monitored for quality and routing.</p>

      <h2>Cookies and Analytics</h2>
      <p>This site may use cookies and third-party analytics and advertising tools to understand how visitors use the site and to improve it. You can control cookies through your browser settings. Disabling cookies may affect how the site functions.</p>

      <h2>Third-Party Links</h2>
      <p>This site may link to third-party websites and authoritative resources. We are not responsible for the privacy practices or content of those sites, and we encourage you to review their policies.</p>

      <h2>Children's Privacy</h2>
      <p>This site is intended for adults and is not directed to children under 13. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children.</p>

      <h2>Your Choices</h2>
      <p>You may request that we stop contacting you, or ask about the information associated with your request, by using the contact details on this site. Depending on where you live, you may have additional rights regarding your personal information under applicable law.</p>

      <h2>Changes to This Policy</h2>
      <p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Changes take effect when posted on this page, and the "last updated" date above reflects the most recent revision.</p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>Questions about this Privacy Policy can be directed to us through the <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>.</p>

      <p style="font-size:.85rem;color:var(--muted);border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:16px;margin-top:24px">{site.brand} is a free service to assist homeowners and property owners in connecting with local service providers for flat roofing. All contractors/providers are independent and {site.brand} does not warrant or guarantee any work performed. It is the responsibility of the property owner to verify that the hired contractor furnishes the necessary license and insurance required for the work being performed. All persons depicted in a photo or video are actors or models and not contractors listed on {site.brand}.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
